{"2771220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Tragedy at Deer Creek", "steam_appid": 2771220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771220/extras/f6e04d564eaca53b616e7f47cffec101.avif?t=1783868408\" width=1560 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771220/extras/dbf25ed5fbb8826edc18d0e51a7e5afc.poster.avif?t=1783868408\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771220/extras/dbf25ed5fbb8826edc18d0e51a7e5afc.webm?t=1783868408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771220/extras/dbf25ed5fbb8826edc18d0e51a7e5afc.mp4?t=1783868408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">'The Tragedy at Deer Creek' is a cinematic adventure set in a remote, long abandoned logging camp, exploring the ambition, hardship and struggles of its people, and the tragedy that ultimately befell them. A story about the bonds of family and the sacrifices we make to protect those we love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771220/extras/f0cae834a5c95f080f05ce4cc41ea566.avif?t=1783868408\" width=1560 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771220/extras/465c1298a3421fec36a299be5022c17f.poster.avif?t=1783868408\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771220/extras/465c1298a3421fec36a299be5022c17f.webm?t=1783868408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771220/extras/465c1298a3421fec36a299be5022c17f.mp4?t=1783868408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore the abandoned camp and uncover fragments of the lives once lived there. <br>Each discovery draws you deeper into the story of its people <br><br>...and the events that changed everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771220/extras/183fdad43e076674ebf6ff9254d5f470.avif?t=1783868408\" width=1560 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771220/extras/bf7f84c9f63df8298f7bec87afdf6888.poster.avif?t=1783868408\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771220/extras/bf7f84c9f63df8298f7bec87afdf6888.webm?t=1783868408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771220/extras/bf7f84c9f63df8298f7bec87afdf6888.mp4?t=1783868408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find items from the past, holding clues as to what happened at Deer Creek. <br>Some were never meant to be found, some hidden in plain sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771220/extras/46524e261c6f8c4a0008b60c54283474.avif?t=1783868408\" width=1560 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771220/extras/4a85f1867dca095825766c98023ce245.avif?t=1783868408\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771220/extras_big/4a85f1867dca095825766c98023ce245.webp?t=1783868408 width=1560 height=660 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Photographer Charlotte Gray ventures to the long-abandoned logging camp at Deer Creek to complete her project ”Forgotten Frontiers” - a visual record of places time has slowly erased, and the quiet stories left in its wake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">What she finds is not simply an abandoned camp, but one that feels suspended in time, as though held in place by something unseen, as if its occupants stepped away only moments ago rather than decades. And in the heavy stillness of the vast, frozen landscape, Charlotte begins to sense something dormant - Deer Creek does not merely hold the stories of its past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>It yearns to set them free.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771220/extras/b8905fa1f12a539cd339e51ccba7cf50.webp?t=1783868408\" width=1560 height=11 /></span><strong>Key Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Cinematic Point-and-Click Adventure</strong> <br>A story-driven adventure game, blending exploration and cinematic cutscenes with puzzle elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Tragic Tale of Family</strong> <br>A heart-wrenching story about the lengths we can go to protect the ones we love</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art Style and Atmosphere</strong> <br>A haunting soundtrack and hand-crafted pixel art create an eerie, immersive, fully voiced gameplay experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Focused</strong><br>Uncover a rich storyline that paints the lives of the people who lived in Deer Creek, their relationships and secrets     <br>  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Technical Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Accessible, Narrative-driven Point-and-Click Adventure Game</strong><br>A simple single-click interface makes the game easy for anyone to play  </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2771220/extras/f6e04d564eaca53b616e7f47cffec101.avif?t=1783868408\" width=1560 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a